* MINT-ERRORS: 
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
SET DOHISTORY ON
SET HISTORY TO 5
DO HISTLONG
SET HISTORY OFF
SET HISTORY OFF
? "[AFTER OFF]"
LIST HISTORY
SET HISTORY ON
SET DOHISTORY ON
DO HISTON
SET DOHISTORY OFF
? "[ON RECORDS]"
LIST HISTORY
SET HISTORY TO 16000
? "[16000]"
LIST HISTORY
SET HISTORY TO 16001
? "[16001]"
SET HISTORY TO 2.9
? "[FRACTION]"
